%% title: Provision a Mailbox
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as estate-kit service
    participant F as Flux
    participant K as API server
    participant M as mail provisioner
    participant ST as Stalwart
    participant V as Vault
    S->>F: Project render with Mailbox objects
    F->>K: apply the Mailbox
    M->>K: watch Mailboxes by label
    M->>V: read the generated password
    M->>ST: create or update the account
    M->>K: write status
